From: nxrs contributors
Subject: [PATCH] dropbear: bound native service ownership and qualify entropy

Keep the daemon foreground, single-owner and single-channel. Expose independent
status/stop controls, retain cleanup barriers, use the qualified fallible native
entropy device and require provisioned host identity by default.

